{"id":17503,"name":"Miami County","slug":"miami-county","state":"Ohio","code":"OH","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/hybrid/hybrid-tax-sales-states/ohio-tax-deed-and-tax-liens/miami-county/","lastUpdated":"2025-05-06T02:29:15","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Foreclosure Sale / Tax Deed","bidProcedure":"Premium Bid","extra":[{"label":"Typical Date of Sale","value":"Every Wednesday at 10:00 AM EST"},{"label":"Deposit Requirements","value":"$2,000 for properties under $10,000, $5,000 for properties between $10,000 and $200,000, $10,000 for properties over $200,000"},{"label":"Sale Contact","value":"Sheriff’s Office"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"Miami County Auction Site"},{"label":"County Website","value":"Miami County, OH – Official Website"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"AQfqNm1dxOrSha73wzI\"><iframe title=\"Smart Investing: Unlocking Value in Low-Cost Properties - Miami County - Ohio Tax Lien &amp; Deed Invest\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gvTGCqzHqfE?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Discover-Miami-County,-Ohio-Tax-Lien-Sales\">Get Cheap Properties at Miami County, Ohio Tax Sales</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Are you looking for a way to invest in real estate without breaking the bank? Look no further than Miami County, <a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/hybrid/hybrid-tax-sales-states/ohio-tax-deed-and-tax-liens/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Ohio</mark></a>! Every Wednesday, the county holds Tax Foreclosure Sales (also known as Tax Deed auctions), where you can buy properties at prices far below market value. I&#8217;ll walk you through the steps to start and provide all the key details.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Understanding-Tax-Foreclosure-Sales\">Understanding Tax Foreclosure Sales in Miami County</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>In Miami County, tax foreclosure sales allow investors to purchase properties when the owners have failed to pay their property taxes. Realauction hosts these sales online, allowing you to participate easily from anywhere.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>How It Works:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Registration</strong>: First, register on the <a href=\"https://miami.sheriffsaleauction.ohio.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Miami County Foreclosure Auction website</mark></a> by completing the Purchaser Information Form.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Bidding</strong>: Properties are available for proxy bidding seven days before the sale date.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Deposit</strong>: The required deposit varies:\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Properties under $10,000: $2,000</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Properties between $10,000 and $200,000: $5,000</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Properties over $200,000: $10,000</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<p>You must make deposits via bank wire transfer or ACH payment; the sale does not accept cash deposits.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Steps-to-Start-Investing\">Steps to Start Investing in Miami County</h2>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Research and Understand Local Laws</strong>:\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It&#8217;s crucial to familiarize yourself with the legal framework and regulations in Miami County.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Visit the <a href=\"https://www.co.miami.oh.us/191/Treasurer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Miami County Treasurer&#8217;s website</mark></a> for more information.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Visit the Auction Site</strong>:\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Register on the <a href=\"https://miami.sheriffsaleauction.ohio.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Miami County Auction Site</mark></a> to start bidding.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Review the auction rules and procedures thoroughly.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Read Details About Tax Foreclosure Sales</strong>:\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Sales are held every Wednesday at 10:00 AM Eastern Time.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Only one property is sold at a time, ensuring a fair process.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Contact the County Office for Inquiries</strong>:\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>For questions, you can contact the Miami County Treasurer&#8217;s Office at (937) 440-6045 or email them at <a href=\"mailto:treasurer@miamicountyohio.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">treasurer@miamicountyohio.gov</mark></a>.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Miami-County-Ohio-Courthouse-1081x720.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Miami-County-Ohio-Courthouse-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Miami-County-Ohio-Courthouse-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Miami-County-Ohio-Courthouse-768x511.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Miami-County-Ohio-Courthouse-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Miami-County-Ohio-Courthouse-32x21.webp 32w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Miami-County-Ohio-Courthouse-1536x1023.webp 1536w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Miami-County-Ohio-Courthouse.png 1757w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Miami-County-Ohio-Courthouse-1081x720.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Miami-County-Ohio-Courthouse-1081x720.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Miami-County-Ohio-Courthouse-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Miami-County-Ohio-Courthouse-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Miami-County-Ohio-Courthouse-768x511.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Miami-County-Ohio-Courthouse-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Miami-County-Ohio-Courthouse-32x21.png 32w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Miami-County-Ohio-Courthouse-1536x1023.png 1536w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Miami-County-Ohio-Courthouse.png 1757w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-17508 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Miami County Ohio Courthouse\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Details\">Important Details</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Pro-Tips\">Pro Tips</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Attend a Training Session</strong>: Realauction conducts virtual training classes regularly. Register by contacting Realauction Customer Service at (877) 361-7325.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Plan Your Finances</strong>: Ensure your deposit is ready well before the auction date.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Stay Informed</strong>: Regularly check the <a href=\"https://www.co.miami.oh.us/191/Treasurer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Miami County Treasurer&#8217;s website</mark></a> for updates and important announcements.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"FAQs\">FAQs</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What happens if the property owner redeems the lien?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: If the property owner pays their overdue taxes plus interest, you will be reimbursed the amount you paid plus interest.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: Can I inspect the properties before bidding?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: Generally, properties are sold &#8220;as-is&#8221; without inspection. It is advisable to research properties thoroughly before bidding.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: Are there any additional fees?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: Besides the deposit, there may be other costs, such as administrative fees or title search fees.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Useful Links</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.co.miami.oh.us/930/Real-Estate-Sales\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Real Estate Sales</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.co.miami.oh.us/888/Sheriff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Sheriff’s Office</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://miami.sheriffsaleauction.ohio.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Auction Site</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.co.miami.oh.us/191/Treasurer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Treasurer&#8217;s Office</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-need-a-hand\">Need a Hand? </h4>\n\n\n\n<p>If you need assistance with tax lien investing, feel free to <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">reach out for a consultation</mark></a> or access our <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivi